[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     64[0m:[38;5;10m[49m stack frame.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     65[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     66[0m:[38;5;10m[49m For the binary produced by the documented build (gcc without optimisation,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     67[0m:[38;5;10m[49m x86-64, glibc; `luggage_id` at `%rbp-0x8d`) that residue is a single `0x03`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     68[0m:[38;5;10m[49m byte followed by a NUL, and every other buffer starts out zeroed. Measured as
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     69[0m:[38;5;10m[49m stable across repeated runs, across `PAD` environment variables of 1–5000
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     70[0m:[38;5;10m[49m bytes, across argv lengths, with `env -i`, and with stdin from a file or a
